# Static Files for GitHub Pages

This browser runs entirely as a static site on GitHub Pages.

## Files

- `index.html` - Main browser UI
- `browser.js` - Browser logic (tabs, history, navigation)
- `.nojekyll` - Tells GitHub Pages to serve static files as-is

## Deployment

Push to GitHub and it will automatically deploy to GitHub Pages.

Access it at: `https://zubairwasif61-source.github.io/browser`
